      "content": "i get that, but it feels like there's a real imbalance though. it seems like most galleries and museums today basically ignore anything that isn't \"socially conscious\" anymore. isn't it a problem that we're essentially seeing a decline in technical skill and craft because the focus has shifted so heavily toward just sending a message?",
